%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Merchant
    participant P as Sign in / Sign up / Code pages<br/>(cubits)
    participant B as AuthBloc
    participant R as AuthRepository<br/>(Either<Failure, T>)
    participant S as Qorelly Supabase Auth
    participant A as apps/api

    Note over B: App start: AuthStarted
    B->>R: currentUser() (restored supabase_flutter session)
    R-->>B: Right(null) → Unauthenticated / Right(user) → Authenticated
    U->>P: email + password, tap Sign in
    P->>R: SignIn use case
    R->>S: signInWithPassword
    alt failure
        S-->>R: AuthException
        R-->>P: Left(AuthFailure)
        P-->>U: inline error
    else email not confirmed
        S-->>R: AuthException (email not confirmed)
        R-->>P: Left(EmailNotConfirmedFailure)
        P->>S: resend signup code
        P-->>U: code screen (see sign up)
    else success
        S-->>R: session
        R-->>P: Right(MerchantUser)
        P->>B: AuthUserChanged(user)
        B-->>U: HomePage
    end
    opt new merchant
        U->>P: name, email, phone, password, tap Create account
        P->>S: signUp [metadata full_name, phone E.164, role owner]
        Note right of S: Qorelly's handle_new_user trigger writes its profile row
        S-->>P: user, no session (confirmation on)
        P-->>U: code screen
        U->>P: 6-digit code
        P->>S: verifyOTP (email)
        S-->>P: session
        P->>B: AuthUserChanged(user) (pushed auth screens dropped first)
    end
    opt forgot password
        U->>P: email
        P->>S: resetPasswordForEmail
        U->>P: code from the email
        P->>S: verifyOTP (recovery) → session
        U->>P: new password
        P->>S: updateUser(password)
        P->>B: AuthUserChanged(user)
    end
    U->>A: any API call via Dio
    Note right of U: interceptor adds Bearer currentSession.accessToken
